43308 1068 #edb/ref 17592186443298 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443308 1069 "q-174112" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443308 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443308 1071 "$-30-215=${{field-1}}" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443308 1072 #uuid "30d2f725-3679-5a9b-883a-cea7d083fba5" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443308 1074 "The answer will be negative since $-30$ is negative, and we're subtracting $215$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n30+215\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the addition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n30+215=245.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-30-215=-245.\n$$" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1068 #edb/ref 17592186443301 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1069 "q-235765" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1071 "$-18-303=${{field-1}}" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1072 #uuid "4d1b13ee-c2f7-5d7d-b7d0-387ee0a0e47c" 13194139534900 17592186045417 true] [17592186443309 1074 "The answer will be negative since $-18$ is negative, and we're subtracting $303$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n18+303\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the addition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\text{ }1\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,8\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\